ty providers, with automated deployments via GitHub Actions. Managed full product lifecycle from API design and database migration to client handover.","src/content/projects/iro.md","ed1dcb78c5027072",{"html":322,"metadata":323},"\u003Cp>Architected and deployed a production-ready RESTful backend for a real art commission business using Ktor (Kotlin) and MongoDB on Google Cloud Run. Implemented a custom JWT-based authentication system without third-party providers, with automated deployments via GitHub Actions. Managed full product lifecycle from API design and database migration to client handover.\u003C/p>",{"headings":324,"localImagePaths":325,"remoteImagePaths":326,"frontmatter":327,"imagePaths":331},[],[],[],{"title":126,"tagline":309,"screenshots":328,"tags":329,"demoUrl":317,"metrics":330,"featured":291,"order":129},[311],[152,196,313,176],[315,316],[],"iro.md","isyaratku",{"id":333,"data":335,"body":348,"filePath":349,"digest":350,"rendered":351,"legacyId":362},{"title":336,"tagline":337,"screenshots":338,"tags":340,"metrics":344,"repoUrl":347,"featured":291,"order":64},"IsyaratKu","Cloud infrastructure for a cross-functional sign language learning app.",[339],"public/isyaratku.png",[341,342,220,343],"GCP","Cloud Build","REST API",[345,346],"6-Member Cross-Functional Team","Full CI/CD Pipeline","https://github.com/IsyaratKu","Spearheaded the cloud architecture for a cross-functional team (ML, Mobile, Cloud) during the Bangkit Academy Capstone. Defined rigorous infrastructure standards including a full CI/CD pipeline, a custom JWT authentication flow, and highly available storage architecture. Deployed the backend fully containerized on Google Cloud Platform.","src/content/projects/isyaratku.md","745e64a27eba4e0b",{"html":352,"metadata":353},"\u003Cp>Spearheaded the cloud architecture for a cross-functional team (ML, Mobile, Cloud) during the Bangkit Academy Capstone. Defined rigorous infrastructure standards including a full CI/CD pipeline, a custom JWT authentication flow, and highly available storage architecture. Deployed the backend fully containerized on Google Cloud Platform.\u003C/p>",{"headings":354,"localImagePaths":355,"remoteImagePaths":356,"frontmatter":357,"imagePaths":361},[],[],[],{"title":336,"tagline":337,"screenshots":358,"tags":359,"repoUrl":347,"metrics":360,"featured":291,"order":64},[339],[341,342,220,343],[345,346],[],"isyaratku.md","pegon",{"id":363,"data":365,"body":379,"filePath":380,"digest":381,"rendered":382,"legacyId":393},{"title":366,"tagline":367,"screenshots":368,"tags":370,"metrics":375,"demoUrl":378,"featured":291,"order":86},"Pegon","Digital preservation platform for Southeast Asian manuscripts and scripts.",[369],"public/Pegon.png",[371,200,372,373,374],"NestJS","Next.js","React","PWA",[376,377],"OCR Feature","Multi-Script Transliteration","https://pegon.cs.ui.ac.id/app","Contributed as backend developer in a 6-member team for a client-facing software engineering course project. Built backend services using NestJS and Prisma ORM, supporting core features including manuscript upload, user authentication, bookmarking, and OCR-powered character recognition for Southeast Asian scripts. The application was delivered as a cross-platform PWA supporting both web and mobile access.","src/content/projects/pegon.md","ffcbff5374fc50fb",{"html":383,"metadata":384},"\u003Cp>Contributed as backend developer in a 6-member team for a client-facing software engineering course project. Built backend services using NestJS and Prisma ORM, supporting core features including manuscript upload, user authentication, bookmarking, and OCR-powered character recognition for Southeast Asian scripts. The application was delivered as a cross-platform PWA supporting both web and mobile access.\u003C/p>",{"headings":385,"localImagePaths":386,"remoteImagePaths":387,"frontmatter":388,"imagePaths":392},[],[],[],{"title":366,"tagline":367,"screenshots":389,"tags":390,"demoUrl":378,"metrics":391,"featured":291,"order":8